Drop the real extract.osm.pbf file in this directory before running `make up`.

The real file is a binary OSM PBF extract for the V1 bounding box:
  west=-74.000, south=40.795, east=-73.955, north=40.825
  (Morningside Heights + Upper West Side, Manhattan)

Expected size: ~3-8 MB

How to obtain:
  Option A (BBBike, precise bbox):
    Run:  make extract
    This prints the BBBike URL and the curl command to download the file.

  Option B (Geofabrik + osmium clip):
    curl -L https://download.geofabrik.de/north-america/us/new-york-latest.osm.pbf -o new-york-latest.osm.pbf
    osmium extract --bbox -74.000,40.795,-73.955,40.825 new-york-latest.osm.pbf -o infra/osrm/extract.osm.pbf

See infra/osrm/README.md for full instructions.
